i.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1279500/extras/3206dab4c60a2c2f0357b3137d41150c.webm?t=1616428623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1279500/extras/3206dab4c60a2c2f0357b3137d41150c.mp4?t=1616428623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A neverending world in the hands of its players</h2><strong>Perpetual World: </strong>Govern the world together in a game that cannot be shut down, ever, because the data and the logic live in a blockchain network \u2014 instead of the company, the gamers run the world together with no forced updates or changes without community approval.<br><br><strong>Infinite moddability: </strong>Nine Chronicles is one of the first massively multiplayer games to fully support mods and give players the tools to utilize them in an open-source format.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1279500/extras/86235096b859580baf6923d0339157a4.poster.avif?t=1616428623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1279500/extras/86235096b859580baf6923d0339157a4.webm?t=1616428623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1279500/extras/86235096b859580baf6923d0339157a4.mp4?t=1616428623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
